[Music]  so why did I choose this book I chose  this book because because I really liked  it a lot and I used to have a lot of  pressure choosing a book every month I  stopped doing that cuz it's really hard  you think about it yourself those of you  read it's really hard to find a book  that you love that you want to share  with all of your friends every month so  I just wait until I find something  that's fantastic and I want to pass it  along to everybody I know and everybody  I know in the world and that's what  happened I read this book it was sent to  me by the editor at O Magazine in a  stack and I picked it up and loved it  and wanted to pass it on that's how that  happened  [Music]  I think that resonates with me the most  is it's a love story that turns into a  triangle and I don't want to give it  away so we're one person in the triangle  ends up and what that outcome is so it  resonates because it's so current you  know I care a lot about what's happening  in the story and it's so current  [Music]  what struck me about the author is that  it was written as though it felt like I  knew the characters I thought that the  character development was so real that  the that the characters felt like real  people to me like I'd wake up thinking  about them that tell you you know you're  in a good book when you wake up thinking  about the characters and it's hard to  separate sometimes in your mind was that  real did that really happen no okay that  was in a book it was a novel that's how  good it is  [Music]

